                    <h3>What is Travel Insurance?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Travel Insurance is designed to provide financial protection against covered problems that may occur during a trip. Depending on the selected policy, it may cover medical emergencies, trip cancellation or interruption, baggage loss, delays, and other eligible travel-related expenses.
                    </p>

